        "original_id": "26c14a8b-5e0d-5f18-a793-62271ae4b5f4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Vitas Gerulaitis, Heather Watson, Rainer Schuettler, Fernando Verdasco, Vishnu Vardhan\n- Organizations: V Chennai Warriors\n- Events: 1978 Australian Open – Men's Singles\n- Topics: tennis\n\nFacts:\n- Vitas Gerulaitis was born on July 26, 1954, and he was an American professional tennis player.\n- Heather Watson was born on 19 May 1992, and she is a British tennis player and a Wimbledon Mixed Doubles Champion.\n- In 1978, Vitas Gerulaitis was the defending champion for the Australian Open men's singles event, but he did not compete that year.\n- In the 2015 season, V Chennai Warriors was represented by Rainer Schuettler, Fernando Verdasco, Heather Watson, and Vishnu Vardhan.\n- Vitas Gerulaitis died on September 17, 1994.",
